---
import ClientCaseStudyPage from "../../components/ClientCaseStudyPage.astro";
import CaseStudyImageSlot from "../../components/CaseStudyImageSlot.astro";
import { clientCaseStudyMedia } from "../../data/clientCaseStudyMedia";
const media = clientCaseStudyMedia.amber;
---
<ClientCaseStudyPage
  previewOnly={true}
  client="Amber Oxygen Therapy"
  title="Amber Oxygen Therapy: A Short-Form Video Series"
  metaTitle="Amber Oxygen Therapy Video Case Study | NextVision Studio"
  description="A short-form video and photography project for Amber Oxygen Therapy: twelve edited videos, six images and a series built around different questions and details."
  intro="Twelve short videos and six photographs, introducing the space, the experience and the details at Amber Oxygen Therapy."
  service="Short-form video and photography"
  hero={media.hero}
  serviceHref="/short-form-video-production-dublin/"
  serviceLabel="Explore short-form production"
>
  <section id="the-project">
    <h2>A closer look at the business</h2>
    <p>The project brought together short videos and photographs for Amber's social content, covering several aspects of the business in one batch.</p>
    <p>The photographs show the chamber interior, the seats and the surrounding details. They give someone seeing Amber for the first time a clear view of the setting.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="the-series">
    <h2>One subject in each edit</h2>
    <p>The series includes <em>First Session</em>, <em>Look Inside</em> and <em>The Little Details</em>. Each has its own subject, so Amber can choose a piece that fits the message of a particular post.</p>
    <p>Other edits take a more specific angle, including <em>By the Numbers</em>, <em>Watch the Pressure</em> and <em>Your Next Pause</em>. Together, they form a set of separate introductions and details the business can use over time.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="client-image-pair">
    <CaseStudyImageSlot image={media.detail} assetKey="amber:detail" />
    <CaseStudyImageSlot image={media.work} assetKey="amber:work" />
  </div>

  <section id="the-photographs">
    <h2>Photographs to use alongside the videos</h2>
    <p>The six images were part of the delivery. They provide still material for posts and give the business a consistent selection of photographs from the same project.</p>
    <p>For a similar shoot, the <a href="/photography-dublin/">photography list</a> can be planned alongside the video subjects. Agreeing the image count and the kinds of shots needed keeps both parts of the production clear.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="planning-a-similar-shoot">
    <h2>Planning a similar shoot</h2>
    <p>A defined batch suits a business introducing several subjects at once. A <a href="/social-media-content-creation-dublin/">regular content plan</a> can support recurring filming and new topics. The <a href="/blog/content-day-or-business-video/">content day and business video guide</a> explains the difference between a short-video batch and one main film.</p>
  </section>
</ClientCaseStudyPage>
